{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】11月13日now早晨新聞重點</p>\n<p>【黃仁勳辭職】捲入婚外情和間諜風波的黃仁勳辭去英偉達行政總裁一職。受事件影響，英偉達股價一度急跌逾一成。</p>\n<p>【點名部門缺失】瑪麗醫院升降機運作問題調查報告，建築署、機電署遭點名有缺失。</p>\n<p>【南韓男團主題】維港上空上演南韓男團BIGBANG主題無人機表演，為演唱會打響頭炮。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:24:22.980585+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:02:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T23:37:36.116417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T23:17:52.533188+00:00","content_hash":"7facec3e0f484ec2b62bf4f539ce6858aef543816fc8f6c3347ada386a4de36c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T23:24:22.980585+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}